01:07:02,990 --> 01:07:04,370
I can't be carrying that around.

1095
01:07:04,570 --> 01:07:05,810
Maybe soul sand goes in as well.

1096
01:07:08,290 --> 01:07:09,150
Gunpowder is good.

1097
01:07:09,310 --> 01:07:10,350
We can put that in here, I guess.

1098
01:07:11,250 --> 01:07:11,650
Mining.

1099
01:07:12,490 --> 01:07:13,390
Same as that one.

1100
01:07:14,730 --> 01:07:16,250
Except this is more like drop, right?

1101
01:07:16,630 --> 01:07:17,450
Yeah, put it in drops.

1102
01:07:20,730 --> 01:07:23,690
This we can turn into blocks, no?

1103
01:07:25,850 --> 01:07:26,250
E.

1104
01:07:29,170 --> 01:07:29,570
Shit.

1105
01:07:30,130 --> 01:07:32,070
Yeah, no, I don't want to go the other way.

1106
01:07:33,030 --> 01:07:34,110
That's actually really annoying.

1107
01:07:34,330 --> 01:07:35,290
I guess I'll use this.

1108
01:07:36,830 --> 01:07:40,070
This is going to be the glowstone dust box for now.

1109
01:07:40,250 --> 01:07:43,830
Even though it's technically a wood box, don't worry about it.

1110
01:07:44,230 --> 01:07:44,870
It's fine.

1111
01:07:47,570 --> 01:07:48,170
You know what?

1112
01:07:48,410 --> 01:07:50,150
For future me, I'm going to put this in here.

1113
01:07:50,310 --> 01:07:53,530
This is like the exploration of the nether starter pack.

1114
01:07:54,130 --> 01:07:56,410
We've got some ascension blocks and all that.

1115
01:07:59,470 --> 01:08:01,570
Okay, fully repaired, by the way.

1116
01:08:02,550 --> 01:08:03,630
Back in we go.

1117
01:08:06,450 --> 01:08:07,810
Oh, I also forgot to put a timer.

1118
01:08:07,890 --> 01:08:08,430
I'm gonna do that now.

1119
01:08:13,120 --> 01:08:15,220
I just remembered for some odd reason.

1120
01:08:17,780 --> 01:08:18,600
Let's see here.

1121
01:08:20,000 --> 01:08:23,580
Let's put it... 40 minutes from now.

1122
01:08:24,460 --> 01:08:25,920
That's a good time.

1123
01:08:27,660 --> 01:08:28,460
44 minutes.

1124
01:08:28,600 --> 01:08:30,420
I don't know how I just messed it up.

1125
01:08:30,800 --> 01:08:31,040
Okay.

1126
01:08:32,000 --> 01:08:35,860
So... We are actually decently far from home.

1127
01:08:36,060 --> 01:08:37,560
Weirdly enough, I found this place again.

1128
01:08:38,020 --> 01:08:39,040
Isn't that kind of funny?

1129
01:08:41,910 --> 01:08:45,130
I'm tempted to just go along the route again to flex my memory skills.

1130
01:08:45,250 --> 01:08:47,010
I can do the entire path by heart.

1131
01:08:47,290 --> 01:08:48,010
But I'm not gonna.

1132
01:08:48,870 --> 01:08:50,710
Promise me that I know it.

1133
01:08:50,970 --> 01:08:51,430
You see this?

1134
01:08:51,550 --> 01:08:51,990
It's that way.

1135
01:08:52,730 --> 01:08:53,630
I'm just gonna fly.

1136
01:09:06,210 --> 01:09:06,930
One shot!

1137
01:09:08,530 --> 01:09:09,510
Makes me happy.

1138
01:09:13,190 --> 01:09:14,870
Two minutes on fire resistance.

1139
01:09:17,310 --> 01:09:19,870
I wonder if I can use the blue fire for something.

1140
01:09:21,690 --> 01:09:23,970
Like, there's gotta be some use in the game, right?

1141
01:09:25,110 --> 01:09:26,150
For the blue fire.

1142
01:09:35,130 --> 01:09:35,610
Nice.

1143
01:09:48,440 --> 01:09:51,920
How could I ever have explored the nether without the elytra?

1144
01:09:54,460 --> 01:09:57,260
I will never go back to not having an elytra again.

1145
01:09:57,740 --> 01:09:59,100
I can tell you this right now.

1146
01:09:59,220 --> 01:09:59,920
I'm a changed man.

1147
01:10:00,960 --> 01:10:01,960
I'm a convert.

1148
01:10:02,200 --> 01:10:04,600
I'm sorry, but this is the way.

1149
01:10:06,340 --> 01:10:07,180
It's crazy.

1150
01:10:13,740 --> 01:10:14,260
Okay.

1151
01:10:15,220 --> 01:10:16,040
Up here.

1152
01:10:19,290 --> 01:10:20,410
Oh, yeah, give me more.

1153
01:10:21,670 --> 01:10:22,650
Getting all the levels.

1154
01:10:29,590 --> 01:10:31,110
This is a little risky, what I'm doing.

1155
01:10:31,730 --> 01:10:32,990
Standing on the block like that.

1156
01:10:35,190 --> 01:10:36,670
Oh, man, I want netherite.

1157
01:10:41,590 --> 01:10:43,070
I kind of want to go look for it.

1158
01:10:44,370 --> 01:10:46,450
Now that we... Man, we have mending on everything.

1159
01:10:50,260 --> 01:10:59,240
So it's gonna be a piece of cake, especially having all shulker boxes and oh man, the next time we go looking for netherite, it's gonna be a breeze.

1160
01:11:12,390 --> 01:11:16,850
I mean, I know I came here to kill a ghast, you know, but I can't not take this.

1161
01:11:17,030 --> 01:11:17,710
I mean, come on.

1162
01:11:18,290 --> 01:11:19,150
It's experience.

1163
01:11:19,530 --> 01:11:21,430
You gotta... just take it.

1164
01:11:33,630 --> 01:11:37,770
I almost pressed W on that one, and we didn't have a potion on.

1165
01:11:39,270 --> 01:11:40,950
Oy, that would have been death!

1166
01:11:42,190 --> 01:11:42,710
Crazy!

1167
01:11:44,890 --> 01:11:45,670
Watch this.

1168
01:11:51,670 --> 01:11:52,910
Oh, sick!

1169
01:11:53,550 --> 01:11:55,170
Ah, I missed this part, though.

1170
01:11:55,870 --> 01:11:56,030
Fuck.

1171
01:11:57,410 --> 01:11:58,510
Yo, Enderman.

1172
01:11:59,370 --> 01:12:00,050
Enderman.

1173
01:12:11,230 --> 01:12:12,850
We learned our lesson, didn't we?

1174
01:12:13,130 --> 01:12:13,990
Always EDP.

1175
01:12:15,730 --> 01:12:17,370
Absolutely no exceptions here.

1176
01:12:19,650 --> 01:12:21,350
No matter what, we EDP.

1177
01:12:21,890 --> 01:12:23,170
And you know what else?

1178
01:12:23,370 --> 01:12:25,270
I'm even gonna do this while we fight him.

1179
01:12:27,290 --> 01:12:28,930
That's how many precautions I'm taking.

1180
01:12:30,670 --> 01:12:32,050
I'm a changed man, I tell you.

1181
01:12:32,910 --> 01:12:34,370
This guy right here is worrying me.

1182
01:12:35,530 --> 01:12:36,170
Fuck off.

1183
01:12:41,460 --> 01:12:42,660
Waiting for the right opportunity.

1184
01:12:42,860 --> 01:12:43,020
Wait.

1185
01:12:43,340 --> 01:12:44,400
Oh, you're burning, huh?

1186
01:12:46,440 --> 01:12:46,840
Huh?

1187
01:12:54,560 --> 01:12:55,380
Did I kill him?

1188
01:12:57,200 --> 01:12:57,820
Where'd he go?

1189
01:12:58,960 --> 01:13:00,160
Better eat just in case.

1190
01:13:08,490 --> 01:13:09,390
Bro, I have an idea.

1191
01:13:09,890 --> 01:13:10,550
Check this out.

1192
01:13:14,410 --> 01:13:15,550
This is how you kill these people.

1193
01:13:32,540 --> 01:13:33,280
Oh shit!

1194
01:13:33,920 --> 01:13:35,460
Oh, that was way bigger than I thought.

1195
01:13:36,200 --> 01:13:36,980
Oh my god.

1196
01:13:37,600 --> 01:13:38,380
Did I get him?

1197
01:13:39,660 --> 01:13:42,040
I think I got them all.

1198
01:13:42,780 --> 01:13:45,540
I was like, this is so annoying, killing these fucking bastards.

1199
01:13:47,360 --> 01:13:48,300
That's how you do it.

1200
01:13:52,600 --> 01:13:53,400
Easy peasy.

1201
01:14:02,810 --> 01:14:05,250
For a split second, I thought I died.

1202
01:14:07,610 --> 01:14:08,490
But I'm fine.

1203
01:14:09,290 --> 01:14:10,570
Look, every one of them is gone.

1204
01:14:11,030 --> 01:14:13,350
They all died in that explosion.

1205
01:14:13,870 --> 01:14:14,550
Oh, but wait a minute.

1206
01:14:16,630 --> 01:14:20,490
Did that also potentially remove loot?

1207
01:14:22,470 --> 01:14:24,890
I wonder if explosions remove loot.

1208
01:14:25,130 --> 01:14:26,670
I know lava does.

1209
01:14:29,620 --> 01:14:30,100
You know what?

1210
01:14:30,220 --> 01:14:33,580
Let me... Do I have another one?

1211
01:14:38,780 --> 01:14:39,400
I don't.

1212
01:14:39,620 --> 01:14:40,340
Ah, well, whatever.

1213
01:14:41,640 --> 01:14:42,660
I was going to try on this.

1214
01:14:44,060 --> 01:14:45,560
I mean, I could have just been unlucky, I guess.

1215
01:14:47,400 --> 01:14:47,700
Alright.

1216
01:14:54,350 --> 01:14:55,530
Oh, another question.

1217
01:14:55,770 --> 01:14:58,350
Let's say there's a big magma dude, right?

1218
01:14:59,330 --> 01:15:01,370
And I haven't split him in half yet.

1219
01:15:01,610 --> 01:15:02,650
Like, he's massive.

1220
01:15:02,950 --> 01:15:04,230
I explode him?

1221
01:15:04,390 --> 01:15:06,730
I wonder if that will only split him once?

1222
01:15:07,110 --> 01:15:11,190
Or if it will continuously kill the splits after that.

1223
01:15:11,910 --> 01:15:14,670
I guess it depends on how fast they split up, right?

1224
01:15:27,940 --> 01:15:31,100
Bro, getting experience with an elytra is actually a piece of cake.

1225
01:15:33,500 --> 01:15:34,580
This game is easy now.

1226
01:15:51,000 --> 01:15:52,260
Look at all that.

1227
01:15:53,280 --> 01:15:54,540
33 already.

1228
01:15:56,140 --> 01:15:57,940
And I didn't even come here for experience.

1229
01:15:59,780 --> 01:16:03,420
Well, not the major objective, I mean.

1230
01:16:16,780 --> 01:16:17,860
I just had another idea.

1231
01:16:18,840 --> 01:16:24,560
If I bring paper with me to the nether, I can actually infinitely fly in here.

1232
01:16:25,020 --> 01:16:31,100
Because I can keep supplying myself with gunpowder from the ghasts that I kill in here.

1233
01:16:31,300 --> 01:16:32,740
And I can keep making rockets.

1234
01:16:34,800 --> 01:16:35,740
Well, not infinitely.

1235
01:16:35,920 --> 01:16:36,960
Well, as long as I have paper, right?

1236
01:16:37,040 --> 01:16:38,440
But you can have a lot of paper with you.

1237
01:16:53,480 --> 01:16:55,940
I could get lucky here and get, uh, netherite.

1238
01:16:58,160 --> 01:17:01,180
As far as I'm aware, there's no, like, real rule to this.

1239
01:17:01,300 --> 01:17:02,720
It's just, like, it can be anywhere.

1240
01:17:02,900 --> 01:17:03,800
Because I've found it anywhere.

1241
01:17:05,500 --> 01:17:06,840
In any one of these, it could be.

1242
01:17:07,100 --> 01:17:09,300
The only thing I haven't seen... Oh, wait, that's not true, actually.

1243
01:17:09,440 --> 01:17:15,560
I was about to say, you haven't seen it on, like, just... Like, uh, one of the faces of these blocks in the open.

1244
01:17:15,620 --> 01:17:16,120
But that's not true.

1245
01:17:16,180 --> 01:17:16,940
I did see that once.

1246
01:17:17,400 --> 01:17:18,720
But I guess it's just really rare.

1247
01:17:22,760 --> 01:17:25,020
Oh my god, look at all this experience!

1248
01:17:30,460 --> 01:17:35,400
We're gonna make the craziest diamond gear the world has ever seen, and we're gonna convert it all to netherite.

1249
01:17:36,040 --> 01:17:37,860
And I will truly be unkillable.

1250
01:17:56,950 --> 01:17:59,270
Ah, I'm pressing the mouse way too hard again.

1251
01:17:59,710 --> 01:18:01,830
I need to just gently squeeze the trigger.

1252
01:18:06,170 --> 01:18:07,170
Gentle squeeze.

1253
01:18:10,570 --> 01:18:11,650
Okay, watch this way.

1254
01:18:12,510 --> 01:18:13,570
More experience.

1255
01:18:15,970 --> 01:18:17,190
More lambas bread.

1256
01:18:24,590 --> 01:18:33,790
The ironic thing, I came in here to get gas tears so I can make end crystals so I can potentially summon the dragon so I can get experience.

1257
01:18:34,630 --> 01:18:36,810
And I'm actually just getting experience doing this instead.

1258
01:18:38,730 --> 01:18:41,690
Like, the whole idea was to do the dragon so I can get experience, right?

1259
01:18:44,330 --> 01:18:47,970
By the way, I'm just assuming that I'm gonna get the same amount of experience if I kill it again.

1260
01:18:49,230 --> 01:18:50,650
I don't know if that's the case, you know?

1261
01:18:52,300 --> 01:18:54,100
It could very well not be the case.

1262
01:18:54,420 --> 01:18:55,340
In fact, hold on.

1263
01:18:56,020 --> 01:18:58,740
Maybe the dragon will drop new items the second time.

1264
01:18:59,500 --> 01:19:02,500
Sort of like a Noob Game Plus type deal, you know?

1265
01:19:02,620 --> 01:19:03,240
But with a mob?

1266
01:19:04,640 --> 01:19:05,160
Hmm.

1267
01:19:07,640 --> 01:19:08,660
Something to consider.

1268
01:19:12,020 --> 01:19:13,040
Maybe I'm just hoping.

1269
01:19:13,580 --> 01:19:15,860
Because I still haven't made the hammer.

1270
01:19:16,680 --> 01:19:18,960
And I'm still trying to figure out where to get that part.

1271
01:19:22,160 --> 01:19:23,780
Fire protection, 12 seconds.

1272
01:19:24,000 --> 01:19:25,800
God, am I good at checking at the right time.

1273
01:19:31,960 --> 01:19:35,620
I'm kind of stuck in a bit of a ravine here or something.

1274
01:19:36,260 --> 01:19:37,180
Is that the right word?

1275
01:19:40,640 --> 01:19:43,100
I am not gonna use rockets to get up there.

1276
01:19:44,740 --> 01:19:46,380
I don't even have it on!

1277
01:19:46,380 --> 01:19:48,140
I was just about to fly down!

1278
01:19:48,960 --> 01:19:50,400
Thank god I didn't!

1279
01:19:51,980 --> 01:19:53,240
Oh my goodness!

1280
01:19:56,930 --> 01:20:03,370
When I was standing here, I was briefly considering jumping down and just sort of gliding.

1281
01:20:03,630 --> 01:20:04,510
Oh my god.

1282
01:20:05,750 --> 01:20:07,690
So happy I didn't do that.

1283
01:20:10,430 --> 01:20:11,270
Holy shit.

1284
01:20:12,170 --> 01:20:13,850
That would have been a major disaster.

1285
01:20:17,890 --> 01:20:19,230
Take me across like this.

1286
01:20:27,730 --> 01:20:28,530
Here we go.

1287
01:20:29,770 --> 01:20:30,810
We're back up again.

1288
01:20:32,170 --> 01:20:32,610
36.

1289
01:20:37,170 --> 01:20:40,510
I mean, there's just so much quartz here.

1290
01:20:40,630 --> 01:20:44,350
I could keep mining this forever, but... I gotta learn when to stop, you know?

1291
01:20:44,450 --> 01:20:45,590
I gotta start exploring here.

1292
01:20:51,520 --> 01:20:52,740
Why didn't it register?

1293
01:20:53,160 --> 01:20:54,560
What the fuck was that just now?

1294
01:20:56,140 --> 01:20:57,220
Did I not do it right?

1295
01:20:58,080 --> 01:20:58,940
That was weird.

1296
01:20:59,180 --> 01:21:00,160
I was in freefall.

1297
01:21:01,160 --> 01:21:02,200
I pressed twice?

1298
01:21:02,500 --> 01:21:02,800
What?

1299
01:21:05,780 --> 01:21:06,660
Now I'm scared.

1300
01:21:08,120 --> 01:21:09,660
I thought I was consistent with that.

1301
01:21:10,560 --> 01:21:11,700
Turns out I wasn't.

1302
01:21:26,760 --> 01:21:27,200
Okay.

1303
01:21:27,200 --> 01:21:28,740
I mean, I gotta take this.

1304
01:21:28,900 --> 01:21:30,160
I gotta... I gotta fucking... Hold on.

1305
01:21:34,190 --> 01:21:36,050
Oh, it just hit me.

1306
01:21:37,930 --> 01:21:39,010
Oh my god.

1307
01:21:40,630 --> 01:21:43,690
It's so slow because I have no efficiency on it.

1308
01:21:45,670 --> 01:21:47,210
I was really thinking, why?

1309
01:21:47,430 --> 01:21:49,090
Wait, isn't this kind of slow?

1310
01:21:50,490 --> 01:21:52,050
What the fuck am I doing?

1311
01:21:53,150 --> 01:21:55,030
Alright, we're done mining this.

1312
01:21:55,750 --> 01:21:56,910
We're done mining that.

1313
01:21:58,910 --> 01:22:00,370
Something felt off for sure.

1314
01:22:11,610 --> 01:22:12,850
That is so much fun.

1315
01:22:13,230 --> 01:22:15,210
You know what would be really fun, actually?

1316
01:22:15,710 --> 01:22:24,030
And I bet people have done this, but... You could sort of make a level where you have to avoid obstacles, you know?

1317
01:22:24,250 --> 01:22:30,570
Fly into tight crevices and avoid narrow corridors, you know?

1318
01:22:31,450 --> 01:22:32,450
That would be fun.

1319
01:22:38,850 --> 01:22:40,950
Okay, I said no more mining this.

1320
01:22:41,130 --> 01:22:41,610
Why am I doing that?

1321
01:22:41,670 --> 01:22:42,270
Why am I mining it?

1322
01:22:42,410 --> 01:22:43,010
Stop mining it.

1323
01:22:43,450 --> 01:22:43,930
We're done.

1324
01:22:47,530 --> 01:22:49,170
Give me the ghasts.

1325
01:22:51,770 --> 01:22:52,210
Now.

1326
01:22:53,090 --> 01:22:55,130
Oh, that's very far down.

1327
01:22:56,610 --> 01:22:57,850
We have Elytra, though.

1328
01:23:00,190 --> 01:23:01,610
Okay, okay, watch this.

1329
01:23:02,170 --> 01:23:03,210
See, I'm up high.

1330
01:23:03,390 --> 01:23:04,110
He's down low.

1331
01:23:04,590 --> 01:23:04,890
One shot.

1332
01:23:06,690 --> 01:23:07,310
Okay, wait.

1333
01:23:07,590 --> 01:23:08,790
So, I hit him in the leg.

1334
01:23:08,910 --> 01:23:09,470
Maybe that's different.

1335
01:23:13,660 --> 01:23:15,580
Um, we're gonna have to do more testing.

1336
01:23:18,120 --> 01:23:18,920
What's that?

1337
01:23:20,120 --> 01:23:21,200
Oh, it's bone.

1338
01:23:24,880 --> 01:23:26,260
Oh, here we go.

1339
01:23:33,120 --> 01:23:33,720
Oh!

1340
01:23:35,320 --> 01:23:35,920
Whoa!

1341
01:23:37,620 --> 01:23:38,220
Whoa!

1342
01:23:41,560 --> 01:23:42,500
Where am I going?

1343
01:23:44,580 --> 01:23:45,060
Hello.

1344
01:23:47,160 --> 01:23:49,120
Okay, he didn't die from one shot.

1345
01:23:49,980 --> 01:23:51,120
Two shots on him.

1346
01:23:58,680 --> 01:24:00,020
I'm very far down now.

1347
01:24:00,140 --> 01:24:00,980
Is this a good idea, though?

1348
01:24:03,400 --> 01:24:05,340
Okay, where would the ghasts be?

1349
01:24:05,480 --> 01:24:07,080
Probably open areas, right?

1350
01:24:07,500 --> 01:24:08,280
Open rooms.

1351
01:24:15,760 --> 01:24:16,280
Beautiful.

1352
01:24:16,280 --> 01:24:18,600
So let's find some big open rooms.

1353
01:24:28,660 --> 01:24:29,860
Where should I launch?

1354
01:24:31,300 --> 01:24:33,100
I'm gonna launch... didn't I come from here?

1355
01:24:37,210 --> 01:24:37,890
Fuck it.

1356
01:24:39,450 --> 01:24:39,990
Oh,

1357
01:24:43,210 --> 01:24:44,050
