2185
02:16:34,540 --> 02:16:35,520
Can you shut up?

2186
02:16:37,080 --> 02:16:38,500
I'm trying to play a game here.

2187
02:16:44,100 --> 02:16:44,900
Throw this away.

2188
02:16:47,460 --> 02:16:49,140
My goddamn phone went off.

2189
02:16:49,320 --> 02:16:53,220
I really need to figure out how to not make it automatically activate.

2190
02:16:53,560 --> 02:16:54,740
I don't know how it's doing that.

2191
02:16:56,640 --> 02:17:00,000
Usually I have to go okay or something, you know?

2192
02:17:00,620 --> 02:17:03,080
But it's not responding to that right now, it seems.

2193
02:17:03,520 --> 02:17:04,260
Eat this.

2194
02:17:09,430 --> 02:17:11,410
Man, this one chicken here has been annoying me.

2195
02:17:11,690 --> 02:17:12,870
That is an annoying chicken.

2196
02:17:16,170 --> 02:17:18,310
We've got rockets, we've got elytra.

2197
02:17:20,410 --> 02:17:21,870
Kinda just wanna explore a little bit.

2198
02:17:22,150 --> 02:17:24,150
Oh yeah, I wanted to go caving anyway.

2199
02:17:24,450 --> 02:17:25,750
Normal caving for normal people.

2200
02:17:26,190 --> 02:17:28,190
We're not gonna go into the nether.

2201
02:17:28,590 --> 02:17:31,490
Because we got the levels, we got all that, we need iron now.

2202
02:17:31,590 --> 02:17:33,150
And a lot of iron.

2203
02:17:35,980 --> 02:17:36,920
I need these back.

2204
02:17:38,400 --> 02:17:40,400
Turn these into blocks, I guess.

2205
02:17:40,580 --> 02:17:40,860
Why not?

2206
02:17:44,760 --> 02:17:45,200
Yep.

2207
02:17:45,580 --> 02:17:46,440
We're being efficient.

2208
02:17:46,960 --> 02:17:47,680
How's the shield?

2209
02:17:48,000 --> 02:17:49,900
It's almost gone, so we're gonna destroy it.

2210
02:17:50,740 --> 02:17:51,180
Boom.

2211
02:17:52,260 --> 02:17:53,100
Play it safe.

2212
02:17:54,060 --> 02:17:55,560
Make one of these bad boys.

2213
02:17:57,320 --> 02:17:58,060
There we are.

2214
02:17:58,160 --> 02:17:59,880
Oh, we can change this guy now as well.

2215
02:18:00,080 --> 02:18:00,520
Wonderful.

2216
02:18:03,460 --> 02:18:03,900
Boop.

2217
02:18:05,260 --> 02:18:07,880
And this one will have to go back in here before it gets destroyed.

2218
02:18:13,400 --> 02:18:13,740
Chains?

2219
02:18:13,740 --> 02:18:14,700
Yeah, put them in here.

2220
02:18:14,840 --> 02:18:15,060
It's fine.

2221
02:18:16,400 --> 02:18:19,000
Now, didn't I also have a... Ah, there it is.

2222
02:18:20,840 --> 02:18:22,380
Here we can put all kinds of stuff.

2223
02:18:25,510 --> 02:18:26,650
Magma cream, for example.

2224
02:18:28,150 --> 02:18:28,910
Spectral arrows.

2225
02:18:29,330 --> 02:18:30,230
And all these arrows.

2226
02:18:30,390 --> 02:18:31,170
We don't need all those.

2227
02:18:31,410 --> 02:18:33,510
In fact, we don't need these arrows except one.

2228
02:18:36,210 --> 02:18:36,610
Shovel.

2229
02:18:38,830 --> 02:18:39,230
Music.

2230
02:18:40,770 --> 02:18:42,010
Ah, fuck these things.

2231
02:18:43,170 --> 02:18:44,890
Still haven't found a use for the nether bricks.

2232
02:18:51,600 --> 02:18:55,740
Now, is there a reason to even... Is this place even significant anymore?

2233
02:18:56,880 --> 02:18:57,760
Don't think it is.

2234
02:18:58,200 --> 02:19:00,000
I rinsed this place of all the loot.

2235
02:19:00,220 --> 02:19:05,040
There's no need to have this place.

2236
02:19:06,400 --> 02:19:07,580
Okay, they're not coming for me.

2237
02:19:08,120 --> 02:19:09,740
I will need to destroy this.

2238
02:19:12,360 --> 02:19:13,560
Thank you, and now I'm gone.

2239
02:19:15,100 --> 02:19:16,080
Just like a magician.

2240
02:19:18,020 --> 02:19:18,460
Poof!

2241
02:19:19,880 --> 02:19:21,220
Now I shall destroy this.

2242
02:19:21,700 --> 02:19:24,120
Erase every single trace of me being here.

2243
02:19:25,280 --> 02:19:28,120
Ah, we're gonna need a better pickaxe.

2244
02:19:34,800 --> 02:19:35,560
Loud noise.

2245
02:19:36,300 --> 02:19:37,320
See, that's what I mean.

2246
02:19:37,880 --> 02:19:44,660
That is such a startlingly loud noise to have in the game, compared to all the other sound levels.

2247
02:19:49,750 --> 02:19:50,790
It's weird mixing.

2248
02:20:06,330 --> 02:20:07,550
Yeah, I'm taking all of it.

2249
02:20:23,640 --> 02:20:24,000
Okay.

2250
02:20:24,000 --> 02:20:24,700
There we are.

2251
02:20:25,560 --> 02:20:26,220
20 of those.

2252
02:20:26,320 --> 02:20:27,380
We can make two portals with that.

2253
02:20:28,520 --> 02:20:28,880
Good.

2254
02:20:30,380 --> 02:20:31,300
Soul speed boots.

2255
02:20:31,960 --> 02:20:32,940
This one goes in here.

2256
02:20:33,380 --> 02:20:34,000
Can that go in here?

2257
02:20:34,140 --> 02:20:34,720
Oh, wonderful.

2258
02:20:36,280 --> 02:20:37,180
The one chicken.

2259
02:20:37,640 --> 02:20:38,140
You know what?

2260
02:20:38,140 --> 02:20:38,580
I'll have it here.

2261
02:20:41,700 --> 02:20:43,220
Leather, uh, drops.

2262
02:20:45,460 --> 02:20:49,620
Yeah, all this is... I only got a single ghast here from that whole expedition.

2263
02:20:50,860 --> 02:20:51,260
What?

2264
02:20:53,840 --> 02:20:55,480
Are you actually kidding me?

2265
02:20:57,700 --> 02:20:58,700
Well, you know what?

2266
02:20:58,740 --> 02:21:00,580
I have a bunch of end crystals at home.

2267
02:21:01,180 --> 02:21:03,400
I can probably make it work.

2268
02:21:03,500 --> 02:21:07,240
In fact, I don't even remember if there was nine or more pillars.

2269
02:21:07,380 --> 02:21:08,560
Maybe it was less than that, actually.

2270
02:21:09,000 --> 02:21:10,260
Nine is a lot, you know?

2271
02:21:10,740 --> 02:21:11,920
Maybe I'm wrong about that.

2272
02:21:12,020 --> 02:21:12,680
I gotta try it.

2273
02:21:13,900 --> 02:21:14,420
Fuck it.

2274
02:21:15,360 --> 02:21:17,080
We're just gonna try with the amount we have now.

2275
02:21:18,760 --> 02:21:19,580
Got the bed.

2276
02:21:20,180 --> 02:21:21,440
We're gonna grab this guy.

2277
02:21:21,880 --> 02:21:23,380
Not with that, with this one.

2278
02:21:26,120 --> 02:21:27,140
This one as well.

2279
02:21:27,280 --> 02:21:27,840
Use this.

2280
02:21:29,100 --> 02:21:29,540
Good.

2281
02:21:30,120 --> 02:21:30,780
Very good.

2282
02:21:32,420 --> 02:21:32,860
Success!

2283
02:21:34,620 --> 02:21:35,320
Hell yeah!

2284
02:21:35,740 --> 02:21:36,540
Now we're gonna fly.

2285
02:21:39,400 --> 02:21:40,780
Now, which way is home?

2286
02:21:41,880 --> 02:21:42,700
That way.

2287
02:21:44,920 --> 02:21:47,100
Oh, wait a sec.

2288
02:21:47,700 --> 02:21:48,920
Maybe I know where I am.

2289
02:21:50,420 --> 02:21:51,440
Where's the sun?

2290
02:21:52,540 --> 02:21:53,140
There.

2291
02:21:55,500 --> 02:21:56,640
That's west.

2292
02:21:57,960 --> 02:21:58,560
North.

2293
02:21:58,860 --> 02:21:59,920
Oh, so I went south.

2294
02:22:01,480 --> 02:22:06,780
That would mean I went in... Yeah, actually, this is the Wonderland.

2295
02:22:07,120 --> 02:22:09,620
The same Winter Wonderland that I was in earlier.

2296
02:22:10,740 --> 02:22:11,280
Right?

2297
02:22:12,420 --> 02:22:13,780
This is that place.

2298
02:22:15,780 --> 02:22:16,820
What is happening here?

2299
02:22:17,980 --> 02:22:20,140
I thought these were houses with windows in them.

2300
02:22:23,240 --> 02:22:26,500
Speaking of houses... No, that doesn't look like a house at all.

2301
02:22:27,240 --> 02:22:30,060
But I think I did see something over that way when I flew before.

2302
02:22:31,820 --> 02:22:33,160
Like a... Yeah, see?

2303
02:22:33,360 --> 02:22:33,800
Oh yeah.

2304
02:22:34,600 --> 02:22:36,080
I saw the village.

2305
02:22:38,700 --> 02:22:40,140
Actually a really nice looking one.

2306
02:22:46,780 --> 02:22:50,880
Oh man, I'm gonna... I'm gonna rob these people.

2307
02:22:54,050 --> 02:22:57,130
Where's the, uh, didn't I see blocks of wheat?

2308
02:22:57,970 --> 02:22:58,870
Somewhere here?

2309
02:23:00,730 --> 02:23:02,090
Where are you stashing it?

2310
02:23:04,010 --> 02:23:07,790
Yo, look at this amazing design they've got going.

2311
02:23:12,040 --> 02:23:13,480
Okay, I'm stealing this one.

2312
02:23:15,580 --> 02:23:16,460
What was it?

2313
02:23:18,260 --> 02:23:19,080
There we go.

2314
02:23:21,180 --> 02:23:21,700
Documented.

2315
02:23:23,500 --> 02:23:24,600
I'm stealing this.

2316
02:23:24,860 --> 02:23:26,020
That looks so good.

2317
02:23:26,420 --> 02:23:28,460
We're gonna have one of those in our village.

2318
02:23:29,180 --> 02:23:29,940
There's kids here.

2319
02:23:32,640 --> 02:23:33,160
Ooh.

2320
02:23:35,520 --> 02:23:37,400
Oh, that looks so good.

2321
02:23:43,160 --> 02:23:43,860
Stealing that.

2322
02:23:45,540 --> 02:23:47,720
I'm gonna need a couple of those around the village.

2323
02:23:48,340 --> 02:23:50,940
I think having that would be really nice.

2324
02:23:51,140 --> 02:23:53,820
Adds to the ambiance of everything, right?

2325
02:23:54,460 --> 02:23:55,520
A spruce sign?

2326
02:23:55,660 --> 02:23:56,600
Sure, I'll take it.

2327
02:23:57,960 --> 02:23:58,780
Some bread.

2328
02:23:59,940 --> 02:24:01,840
Oh, pumpkin pie is nice.

2329
02:24:02,700 --> 02:24:04,400
Don't put it there, put it inside.

2330
02:24:08,700 --> 02:24:10,160
The grass one makes no sense.

2331
02:24:10,300 --> 02:24:11,600
Why the fuck did I call it grass?

2332
02:24:12,940 --> 02:24:13,620
It's so dumb.

2333
02:24:13,980 --> 02:24:14,240
Oh god.

2334
02:24:14,380 --> 02:24:14,860
No, no, no, no, no.

2335
02:24:14,980 --> 02:24:15,400
Put it there.

2336
02:24:18,020 --> 02:24:18,640
This is fine.

2337
02:24:19,460 --> 02:24:20,340
I'm happy with that.

2338
02:24:23,400 --> 02:24:25,840
Look at this simplistic roof that I have here as well.

2339
02:24:25,940 --> 02:24:27,420
I actually kind of like this design too.

2340
02:24:30,370 --> 02:24:32,510
Ooh, dude.

2341
02:24:33,470 --> 02:24:36,530
Okay, imagine the bridge that I made, right?

2342
02:24:37,390 --> 02:24:41,250
Close to the water, we're gonna have mossy blocks.

2343
02:24:41,950 --> 02:24:45,030
You know, as if moss from the water.

2344
02:24:47,310 --> 02:24:48,070
You know?

2345
02:24:49,150 --> 02:24:50,610
That can look amazing.

2346
02:24:52,790 --> 02:24:54,290
Should I steal all that then?

2347
02:24:54,670 --> 02:24:56,210
I don't want to destroy this village.

2348
02:24:56,630 --> 02:24:57,450
What is...

2349
02:24:58,170 --> 02:24:59,050
What?

2350
02:25:00,850 --> 02:25:01,850
What?!

2351
02:25:01,850 --> 02:25:06,650
Demon cow!

2352
02:25:07,890 --> 02:25:09,890
The fuck is this?!

2353
02:25:20,430 --> 02:25:21,670
I have no idea.

2354
02:25:23,310 --> 02:25:24,470
Oh, we got lava.

2355
02:25:24,610 --> 02:25:25,470
That explains it.

2356
02:25:25,570 --> 02:25:25,690
Okay.

2357
02:25:26,150 --> 02:25:28,530
What the... Are you a buffalo?

2358
02:25:28,690 --> 02:25:29,130
What are you?

2359
02:25:31,210 --> 02:25:31,730
Buffalo.

2360
02:25:32,890 --> 02:25:34,210
That looks like a buffalo.

2361
02:25:36,450 --> 02:25:37,590
You have a uterus?

2362
02:25:45,050 --> 02:25:46,010
Oh, here we go.

2363
02:25:46,150 --> 02:25:46,630
Here are the houses.

2364
02:25:47,450 --> 02:25:48,150
Living quarters.

2365
02:25:49,770 --> 02:25:51,790
I've come to a strange land here.

2366
02:25:53,670 --> 02:25:55,010
With strange people.

2367
02:25:56,050 --> 02:25:59,010
Oh, I actually do want to rob these people of their beds.

2368
02:25:59,990 --> 02:26:01,910
I'm sorry, but I'm gonna take that.

2369
02:26:04,890 --> 02:26:05,890
Okay, you know what?

2370
02:26:06,170 --> 02:26:08,510
Do they drop... was it steaks?

2371
02:26:10,730 --> 02:26:11,790
Weird buffalo.

2372
02:26:12,130 --> 02:26:13,330
Doesn't look like one at all.

2373
02:26:18,780 --> 02:26:19,440
Taking that.

2374
02:26:22,140 --> 02:26:24,120
Yeah, they don't stack, so that's the problem here.

2375
02:26:24,920 --> 02:26:29,080
I think I should steal this bell!

2376
02:26:29,660 --> 02:26:31,560
It's worth quite a lot, isn't it?

2377
02:26:32,880 --> 02:26:33,300
Yoink!

2378
02:26:33,700 --> 02:26:34,340
It's mine.

2379
02:26:36,360 --> 02:26:36,800
Dankeschön!

2380
02:26:40,010 --> 02:26:42,170
The double door protection strategy.

2381
02:26:44,190 --> 02:26:48,830
Wouldn't have taken these guys for the DDPS strategy here, but, you know, it is what it is.

2382
02:26:49,870 --> 02:26:52,650
You find the most surprising things in the remotest corners.

2383
02:26:54,870 --> 02:26:55,430
Okay.

2384
02:27:00,750 --> 02:27:01,710
That is new.

2385
02:27:02,270 --> 02:27:03,430
They added that.

2386
02:27:03,770 --> 02:27:04,170
Right?

2387
02:27:04,630 --> 02:27:05,470
Look at that.

2388
02:27:10,630 --> 02:27:11,750
That's so cool.

2389
02:27:11,890 --> 02:27:12,670
It looks really nice.

2390
02:27:18,030 --> 02:27:19,070
Oh, oh god.

2391
02:27:20,870 --> 02:27:21,810
Wanna dance?

2392
02:27:31,810 --> 02:27:33,550
Oh, fireflies!

2393
02:27:37,300 --> 02:27:38,840
Unless this is a new biome.

2394
02:27:40,160 --> 02:27:40,720
Wait.

2395
02:27:41,080 --> 02:27:43,660
I did actually have something to explore still.

2396
02:27:44,640 --> 02:27:46,060
No, three biomes to go.

2397
02:27:50,920 --> 02:27:51,880
Firefly bush.

2398
02:27:54,060 --> 02:27:54,620
Yo!

2399
02:27:55,800 --> 02:27:56,980
I'm bringing that home.

2400
02:27:57,120 --> 02:27:58,680
That would look amazing in our village.

2401
02:28:04,570 --> 02:28:05,130
Dude!

2402
02:28:05,130 --> 02:28:06,690
It even made sounds, listen.

2403
02:28:07,610 --> 02:28:08,790
The fireflies, you can hear them.

2404
02:28:13,530 --> 02:28:18,830
The fallen leaves tell us... Story!

2405
02:28:19,610 --> 02:28:20,530
Oh, God.

2406
02:28:27,490 --> 02:28:28,570
Okay, I should go to bed.

2407
02:28:38,830 --> 02:28:45,250
Okay, so home is that way, which is north... well, kind of north of here.

2408
02:28:45,950 --> 02:28:48,250
More like, yeah, northwest of here.

2409
02:28:54,010 --> 02:28:54,710
Let's go.

2410
02:29:03,270 --> 02:29:06,610
Okay, will I make it home on 12 Rockets?

2411
02:29:08,570 --> 02:29:09,530
Come on.

2412
02:29:11,210 --> 02:29:12,450
Can I do it?

2413
02:29:14,410 --> 02:29:16,290
Lock in your choice now.

2414
02:29:24,340 --> 02:29:26,240
Once you've made your choice, you can't change it.

2415
02:29:26,540 --> 02:29:27,160
Remember that.

2416
02:29:29,020 --> 02:29:29,960
Wait, have I been there?

2417
02:29:31,120 --> 02:29:32,660
That looks like the work of me.

2418
02:29:35,120 --> 02:29:35,920
I've done that.

2419
02:29:38,260 --> 02:29:40,700
What I didn't tell you is I'm just gonna walk home from now on.

2420
02:29:40,960 --> 02:29:41,360
Ha ha!

2421
02:29:42,900 --> 02:29:43,300
Gotcha!

2422
02:29:45,820 --> 02:29:47,020
Okay, we got cows now.

2423
02:29:50,640 --> 02:29:51,960
Good night, cows.

2424
02:29:53,400 --> 02:29:55,200
Thank you for your meat.

2425
02:29:55,860 --> 02:29:57,080
Much appreciated.

2426
02:30:01,110 --> 02:30:04,930
Oh, wait, this is a... Okay, hold on.

2427
02:30:05,370 --> 02:30:06,490
Are you telling me?

2428
02:30:07,770 --> 02:30:08,750
I tried this once.

2429
02:30:08,910 --> 02:30:09,530
This doesn't work.

2430
02:30:10,610 --> 02:30:13,030
You gotta be absolutely fucking kidding me.

2431
02:30:14,370 --> 02:30:16,290
I'm sorry, but... no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

2432
02:30:17,730 --> 02:30:19,010
I gotta try this once more.

2433
02:30:19,290 --> 02:30:20,610
I must have fucked it up last time.

2434
02:30:20,930 --> 02:30:22,690
You can definitely make a portal like that.

2435
02:30:23,950 --> 02:30:25,370
Otherwise, why would it be like this?

2436
02:30:30,740 --> 02:30:31,660
Get rid of all this.

2437
02:30:33,840 --> 02:30:34,520
Ah, I need more.

2438
02:30:40,860 --> 02:30:41,400
Oh god.

2439
02:30:44,380 --> 02:30:45,080
Wait, what is this?

2440
02:30:53,450 --> 02:30:54,390
You know what?

2441
02:30:55,210 --> 02:30:58,370
I wonder how that would look on the bridge I made.

2442
02:30:58,790 --> 02:30:59,670
Instead of the wood.

2443
02:31:00,970 --> 02:31:01,750
Note to self?

2444
02:31:02,230 --> 02:31:03,670
Actually, I should just make that note.

2445
02:31:07,970 --> 02:31:10,270
Book of... I need a book of thoughts.

2446
02:31:10,490 --> 02:31:11,070
I need a bot.

2447
02:31:13,170 --> 02:31:15,790
Like, this one doesn't really belong in any of this.

2448
02:31:16,010 --> 02:31:17,770
I guess the book of goals will do for now.

2449
02:31:22,210 --> 02:31:27,270
Try iron bars on the bridge.

2450
02:31:29,950 --> 02:31:30,950
Nice.

2451
02:31:33,770 --> 02:31:35,090
Get rid of it.

2452
02:31:42,390 --> 02:31:43,750
Here it comes.

2453
02:31:57,820 --> 02:31:58,260
What?

2454
02:31:58,620 --> 02:31:59,380
Why not?

2455
02:31:59,500 --> 02:31:59,980
Why is it?

2456
02:32:00,040 --> 02:32:01,260
